## GitHub Copilot

### Purpose

GitHub Copilot was used for code autocomplete, small code suggestions, and improving efficiency during development.

The autocomplete feature helped speed up the coding process by suggesting and completing code while I worked.

### Outcome

Copilot helped make the coding process more efficient, particularly when writing repetitive code. This allowed me to focus more on understanding the functionality and making improvements to my projects.

## ChatGPT

### Purpose

ChatGPT was used as a supplementary learning tool for guidance, rubber duck debugging, and writing assistance.

It was also used to discuss possible approaches and improve the clarity of project documentation.

### Outcome

The conversations helped me work through problems, reflect on development decisions, and communicate my project improvements more clearly.

## Independent Work and Responsibility

AI tools were used to support my learning and development workflow rather than replace my own work.

Suggestions were reviewed and adapted where relevant. I remained responsible for the final implementation, decisions, testing, and submitted work.
